              <div class="media-badges">
                <span class="media-badge biome">Southeast Asia</span>
                <span class="media-badge gameplay">Tea &amp; Scroll Craft</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-info">
              <div class="scene-num">04 / 10</div>
              <h4>Southeast Asia: Emerald Bamboo Sanctuary</h4>
              <p class="scene-desc">
                Lush, sun-dappled emerald bamboo forest with a rustic open-air timber tea pavilion, bamboo water fountains (<em>Shishi-odoshi</em>), stepping stones over clear mossy streams, and gentle drifting mist.
              </p>
              <div class="scene-meta">
                <span><strong>Biome:</strong> Bamboo Forest</span>
                <span><strong>Activity:</strong> Mindful Tea &amp; Scroll Drafting</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Scene 5 -->
          <div class="gallery-card">
            <div class="gallery-media">
              <picture>
                <source srcset="/assets/game-design/biome-nordic-fjord.webp" type="image/webp" />
                <img src="/assets/game-design/biome-nordic-fjord.png" alt="Northern Europe Nordic Fjord of Stillness - Minimalist cedar shelter beside mirror-calm fjord water and twilight aurora" loading="lazy" />
              </picture>
              <div class="media-badges">
                <span class="media-badge biome">Northern Europe</span>
                <span class="media-badge gameplay">Fjord Sanctuary</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-info">
              <div class="scene-num">05 / 10</div>
              <h4>Northern Europe: Nordic Fjord of Stillness</h4>
              <p class="scene-desc">
                Minimalist weathered cedar timber shelter and dock nestled beside crystalline mirror-calm fjord waters, framed by dramatic pine-covered granite cliffs and twilight starry skies with faint boreal aurora ribbons.
              </p>
              <div class="scene-meta">
                <span><strong>Biome:</strong> Nordic Fjord</span>
                <span><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Deep Silence &amp; Tidal Calms</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Scene 6 -->
          <div class="gallery-card">
            <div class="gallery-media">
              <picture>
                <source srcset="/assets/game-design/gameplay-writing-desk.webp" type="image/webp" />
                <img src="/assets/game-design/gameplay-writing-desk.png" alt="The Mindful Writing Desk - Washi paper, ceramic sumi inkstone, steaming tea, and wax seals" loading="lazy" />
              </picture>
              <div class="media-badges">
                <span class="media-badge gameplay">Writing UI</span>
                <span class="media-badge craft">Tactile Craft</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-info">
              <div class="scene-num">06 / 10</div>
              <h4>The Mindful Writing Desk</h4>
              <p class="scene-desc">
                An intimate isometric view of a tactile wooden writing desk with handmade textured Washi paper, ceramic sumi inkstone, steaming tea bowl, brass scissors, cinnabar seal paste, and warm amber candlelight.
              </p>
              <div class="scene-meta">
                <span><strong>UI Mode:</strong> Letter Composition</span>
                <span><strong>Features:</strong> Paper Texture &amp; Spring Physics</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

