              <p class="scene-desc">
                A luminous white and gold origami carrier crane landing gracefully on a polished wooden sanctuary veranda, gently unfolding its wings into a handwritten letter bathed in soft morning sunbeams.
              </p>
              <div class="scene-meta">
                <span><strong>Loop:</strong> Asynchronous Letter Delivery</span>
                <span><strong>Interaction:</strong> Unfolding Haptic Animation</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Scene 8 -->
          <div class="gallery-card">
            <div class="gallery-media">
              <picture>
                <source srcset="/assets/game-design/gameplay-river-lanterns.webp" type="image/webp" />
                <img src="/assets/game-design/gameplay-river-lanterns.png" alt="The River of Shared Hopes - Floating lotus lanterns with flickering candlelight drifting on calm river" loading="lazy" />
              </picture>
              <div class="media-badges">
                <span class="media-badge gameplay">Sympathetic Joy</span>
                <span class="media-badge ritual">Muditā</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-info">
              <div class="scene-num">08 / 10</div>
              <h4>The River of Shared Hopes</h4>
              <p class="scene-desc">
                A twilight river illuminated by hundreds of floating low-poly origami lotus lanterns with warm flickering golden candlelight, drifting past mossy riverbanks and reflecting on calm dark water.
              </p>
              <div class="scene-meta">
                <span><strong>Mechanic:</strong> Ephemeral River Blessings</span>
                <span><strong>Response:</strong> Single-Press Gasshō Bow</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Scene 9 -->
          <div class="gallery-card">
            <div class="gallery-media">
              <picture>
                <source srcset="/assets/game-design/gameplay-stamp-collection.webp" type="image/webp" />
                <img src="/assets/game-design/gameplay-stamp-collection.png" alt="Zen Travel & Wisdom Stamp Book - Accordion album filled with cinnabar seal chops and botanical stamps" loading="lazy" />
              </picture>
              <div class="media-badges">
                <span class="media-badge craft">Stamp Book</span>
                <span class="media-badge progression">Non-Vanity</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-info">
              <div class="scene-num">09 / 10</div>
              <h4>Zen Travel &amp; Wisdom Stamp Book</h4>
              <p class="scene-desc">
                An accordion-fold handmade mulberry paper passport album filled with authentic red cinnabar seal chops, geometric botanical stamps, regional temple seals, and calligraphy inscriptions from visited sanctuaries.
              </p>
              <div class="scene-meta">
                <span><strong>Collection:</strong> Regional &amp; Dharma Chops</span>
                <span><strong>Design:</strong> Zero Vanity / Pure Memory</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Scene 10 -->
          <div class="gallery-card">
            <div class="gallery-media">
              <picture>
                <source srcset="/assets/game-design/gameplay-bell-meditation.webp" type="image/webp" />
                <img src="/assets/game-design/gameplay-bell-meditation.png" alt="The Great Bell of Mindfulness - Bronze temple bell emitting visible golden soundwave rings clearing mountain mist" loading="lazy" />
